---
description: Studio, catalog, and generate boundaries the typechecker cannot enforce
alwaysApply: true
---

Generate goes through `src/generation` and server actions. Client code under `src/openhiggsfield` does not call OpenRouter or `/api/v1/videos` or `/api/v1/images`.

New models belong in `src/generation/catalog/`. Do not hardcode a parallel model list in the UI.

Do not add workaround comments. Fix the pattern, then run `pnpm typecheck` and `pnpm verify:studio`.

Cloud agents, Slack, and Sentry are not connected. Do not start them from a chat. `pnpm verify:studio` is the gate.
